              "Name": "Kennedy GO",
              "MessageSubject": "Elevator out of service",
              "MessageBody": "<style type=\"text/css\">.masteroverridePublic_En {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En p {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En div {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En span {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En li {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}</style><div class=\"masteroverridePublic_En\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"\"><div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The elevator connecting the GO platform and the TTC tunnel is out of service. Customers who need this elevator to access the TTC system are advised to use the TTC station elevator on Transway Crescent, adjacent to the south parking lot.<o:p></o:p></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><a href=\"https://www.gotransit.com/en/the-future-and-go/construction-notices/kennedy-go-station-improvement\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Visit the Kennedy GO Station page to find helpful information on departures, a station map and a listing of all the services we have available.</span></b></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Dignity Transportation shuttle service will be available, upon request, for transportation between the west and east side of the station.<o:p></o:p></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Requests must be made 48 hours in advance by calling 416-398-2222 and dial &#8220;0&#8221;. Please follow the signs to find the shuttle locations.<o:p></o:p></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><a href=\"https://www.gotransit.com/en/travelling-on-go/accessibility?utm_source=Website&amp;utm_medium=ServiceUpdates&amp;utm_campaign=ElevatorAccessibility&amp;utm_content=NOCCommunications\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Visit our Accessibility page to see how we are committed to making our services easy for everyone to use.</span></b></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
