              "MessageSubject": "Accessibility ramp is out of service.",
              "MessageBody": "<style type=\"text/css\">.masteroverridePublic_En {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En p {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En div {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En span {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}.masteroverridePublic_En li {font-family: \"Arial\" !important;font-size:10.5pt !important;}</style><div class=\"masteroverridePublic_En\"><div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">The accessibility ramp at Langstaff GO is temporarily out of service until further notice due to an operational issue.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif\">If you require the accessibility coach at Langstaff GO, here&#8217;s what you need to know:</span></strong></div><div><strong><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></strong></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- Shuttle service is available between 06:00- 08:30 and 16:00 - 19:40.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- Call 416-398-2222 and dial &#8216;0&#8217; to book a shuttle.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt; font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- Note: Dignity Shuttle services must be booked 48 hours in advance.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- If you&#8217;re travelling south towards Union Station; prearrange a Dignity shuttle from Langstaff to Old Cummer GO.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- If you&#8217;re travelling north toward Bloomington; prearrange a Dignity shuttle from Langstaff to Richmond Hill GO.</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif\">- If you&#8217;re travelling to Langstaff GO; Exit the train at Old Cummer or Richmond Hill GO, to access your prearranged Dignity shuttle.&nbsp;</span></div></div></div>",
